    "what": "The one source of truth for the Josour identity on the phone and the desktop (Phase 1 decision 1). scripts/brand-theme.py reads it with 1-qantara/ and writes every theme file and brand asset; --check fails when any is stale.",
    "approved": [
      "docs/design/mobile-phase1-foundation.html (phone, v2.6.0)",
      "docs/design/desktop-phase1-foundation.html (desktop, 2026-11-06)"
    ],
    "layout": "color, font (family and weights), radius, space (the 4-px scale), elevation and motion are shared. mobile and desktop hold each app's density: type sizes, sizes and spacing roles."
